{{Short description|List of common names used to refer to fish}}
{{pp|small=yes}} 
[[Common name]]s of fish can refer to a single [[species]]; to an entire group of species, such as a [[genus]] or [[Family (taxonomy)|family]]; or to multiple unrelated species or groups. Ambiguous common names are accompanied by their possible meanings. [[Scientific name]]s for individual species and higher taxa are included in parentheses.

